T3 - Fees (ECONOMICS_PLAN). Gate literally: 10 000 congested blocks (250-block demand segments cycling +25%/-25%/+50%/-50%/target) where the base fee rises and falls per the EIP-1559 formula at every step (base +/- max(base*|gas-target|/target/8, 1), integer arithmetic, minimum one-base-unit change off target). Golden path digest 412f1f9e120ec829fb5d2ae65e4590da69771cd7b49bef83f29440d0d93bc124 pinned in Rust tests and re-derived by the independent Python oracle, which cross-runs t3_fees_example. Base part burned (paid == burned + tips), only the tip goes to the validator; elastic gas target 15 000 000 (limit 30 000 000) enforced. NC: 6/6 named messages (tools/nc_t3.py). 9 gate tests + 3 metamorphisms. Evidence docs/evidence/t3 (536 NCs cumulative over 80 phases). ALL GATES GREEN.
