+  the validator; elastic gas target 15 000 000 (block limit 30 000 000,
+  elasticity 2) enforced by `check_gas`. Pinned scenario `t3_demand`
+  (250-block segments +25 %/−25 %/+50 %/−50 %/target) over 10 000
