+  order T3). Inventory: 80 phases, 536 negative controls cumulative.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- (none)
+
+### Security
+
+- T3 replaces no crypto. The tip is payment for inclusion, not a
+  promise of returns (D-T2); parameters stay governance-locked (D-T1).
